00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:12.479
next he chillin in his office and errything
seem all good.

00:05:12.479 --> 00:05:17.479
Is this cat tryna’ bullshit dareader? And
check this- somethin’ real crazy happens

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:22.500
