real and what ain’t.

00:05:54.759 --> 00:05:59.789
Or maybe it all DID happen, and just nobody trippin on it. All throughout this text we

00:05:59.789 --> 00:06:05.180
see Bateman TRY to get people to see him as the whack-job he is, but nobody eva’ does.

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:28.340
We live in a society where crazy ass violence

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:31.100
go down on the REG, and cuz o dat, people don’t

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:34.349
