00:06:34.349 --> 00:06:37.759
What they sho as hell DO notice, tho, is their SHIT.

00:06:37.759 --> 00:06:42.159
When Bateman ain’t busy slicin’people
to bits o’ whateva, he spend PAGES runnin’

00:06:42.159 --> 00:06:48.530
