00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:46.639
So look- this book got some pretty raw things
to say about our society- and even though

00:07:46.639 --> 00:07:52.610
I dig the message, it ain’t my kinda thing.
To be real wit you- this book is just fucking

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:57.530
BORING. The characters are paper THIN, and
most of the book is just a buncha rambling

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:02.240
bullshit. Yeah, I get it. The book doing that
